&lt;p>想要理解 pybind 的封装逻辑，还需要理解 python 是如何使用 pybind 生成的内容的，即关键点在于 python 的 import 机制的基本原理。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>SSH Local and Remote Port Forwarding</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/ssh-local-and-remote-port-forwarding/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 Nov 2024 22:36:58 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/ssh-local-and-remote-port-forwarding/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><a class="lightgallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png?size=large" data-thumbnail="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png?size=small" data-sub-html="<h2>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png</h2>"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png" alt="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png" srcset="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png?size=small, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png?size=large 2x" data-title="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/gaohongy/cloudImages@master/202411232237252.png" style="background: url(/blog/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/></a> <sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup></p>
<h2 id="understanding-of-forwarding" class="heading-element"><span>Understanding of forwarding</span>
  <a href="#understanding-of-forwarding" class="heading-mark">
    <svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg>
  </a>
</h2><ol>
<li>转发的是什么？</li>
</ol>
<p>答：port forwarding 其中的 port 就已经指明了这一点，传输层的 port 标定了具体的 application，所以转发的实际是对于这个 application 的请求。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>C++ Class Inheritance</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-class-inheritance/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 17:53:07 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-class-inheritance/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="access-modifiers" class="heading-element"><span>Access Modifiers</span>
  <a href="#access-modifiers" class="heading-mark">
    <svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg>
  </a>
</h2><ol>
<li><code>public</code>: 成员可以被任意地方访问，包括类的外部</li>
<li><code>protected</code>: 成员可以被类本身及其子类访问</li>
<li><code>private</code>: 成员只能被类本身访问</li>
</ol>
<p>We can use different modifier to modify super class and different modifier has different effect</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Terminal</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/terminal/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Sep 2024 17:10:35 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/terminal/</guid><description><![CDATA[<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>特性</th>
          <th>真实的虚拟终端 (VT)</th>
          <th>伪终端 (PTS)</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td>硬件依赖</td>
          <td>直接与物理硬件（显示器、键盘）交互</td>
          <td>软件仿真，不直接与物理硬件交互</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>设备文件</td>
          <td>/dev/tty1, /dev/tty2 等</td>
          <td>/dev/pts/0, /dev/pts/1 等</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>使用场景</td>
          <td>物理机的控制台登录，无需图形界面</td>
          <td>图形终端仿真器、远程登录（如 SSH）会话</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>固定数量</td>
          <td>通常有 6 个或更多虚拟终端</td>
          <td>动态创建，按需分配</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>终端切换方式</td>
          <td>Ctrl + Alt + F1 到 Ctrl + Alt + F6</td>
          <td>软件仿真器或通过网络远程连接，如 ssh 登录</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>通过 <code>/proc/&lt;PID&gt;</code> 可以查看进程的相关信息，一些命令的实现也是基于这个文件</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Linux Device Drivers</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/linux-device-drivers/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Sep 2024 14:57:57 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/linux/linux-device-drivers/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="层次结构" class="heading-element"><span>层次结构</span>
  <a href="#%e5%b1%82%e6%ac%a1%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84" class="heading-mark">
    <svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg>
  </a>
</h2><p>在了解驱动程序的具体内容之前，我们可以首先从 Nvidia GPU 所提供的一些 API 层级入手来理解整体的结构，下图展示了上层应用程序在使用 <code>cudaMalloc</code> 时的调用流程图，其中的重点就是 Runtime API, Driver API 和 驱动程序。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Runtime</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 14:41:40 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>在主板上增加 PLX 芯片以提供更多的 PCIe 通道</p>
<p>PCIe 设备插到 PCIe 插槽需要由 PLX 芯片提供支持</p>
<p>一个PCIe插槽在物理层面上确实只能插入一个设备。例如，你只能插入一张显卡或一块SSD到一个PCIe插槽中。但是通过PLX芯片等交换设备，可以让多个PCIe设备通过该插槽共享带宽并同时被RC识别和使用(PLX芯片实际上是在分配带宽，这并没有改变某一时刻 RC 只会和某个插槽上的一台设备进行通信的事实，对于资源有限的PCIe插槽环境比较有意义）</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Debugging With GDB</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/project-experience/debugging-with-gdb/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2024 10:58:33 +0800</pubDate><author>Author</author><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/project-experience/debugging-with-gdb/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="how-to-launch-a-program" class="heading-element"><span>How to launch a program</span>
